WEBVTT

STYLE
::cue(c.color9CD5FF) { color: #9CD5FF; }

1
00:00:01.000 --> 00:00:07.000 line:5% align:center
<b><c.color9CD5FF>One Pace Addon</c></b>

2
00:00:13.990 --> 00:00:19.250
<b>One Piece</b>

3
00:00:14.830 --> 00:00:19.250
<b>Wano Arc</b>

4
00:01:41.620 --> 00:01:46.170
<b>Amigasa Village</b>

5
00:01:42.470 --> 00:01:46.390
[LUFFY]
So. Why were those guys
coming after you, anyway?

6
00:01:47.700 --> 00:01:49.160
I'll tell you.

7
00:01:52.750 --> 00:01:56.130
[OTAMA]
I was on my way to the market
to help with some shopping

8
00:01:56.130 --> 00:02:01.180
when those big mean men with the giant
baboon spotted me and tried to hurt me.

9
00:02:04.300 --> 00:02:07.810
[OTAMA]
That's when Komachiyo
jumped in to save me from them!

10
00:02:09.180 --> 00:02:13.220
Ohh. So that's why you two
were fighting, then.

11
00:02:15.400 --> 00:02:17.230
But that's not all.

12
00:02:18.610 --> 00:02:21.110
[OTAMA]
They stole everything I had on me!

13
00:02:21.110 --> 00:02:26.410
I got real, real mad, and I said
something that was against the law.

14
00:02:31.710 --> 00:02:34.800
The Kozuki Clan is gonna come back!

15
00:02:37.470 --> 00:02:38.920
[MASSUI]
What was that?

16
00:02:39.760 --> 00:02:42.140
[Otama screams]
Let go of me!

17
00:02:42.140 --> 00:02:43.970
[cackles]

18
00:02:45.600 --> 00:02:50.230
You know, if it weren't for you,
I'd probably still be with those awful jerks,

19
00:02:50.230 --> 00:02:52.770
and I'd never see my home again!

20
00:02:52.770 --> 00:02:54.650
I owe you one for helping me!

21
00:02:54.650 --> 00:02:55.680
So thanks a lot!

22
00:02:55.680 --> 00:02:59.640
[OTAMA]
Now let me do a favor
for you, too, okay?

23
00:02:59.640 --> 00:03:01.680
[LUFFY]
Oh, that would be great!

24
00:03:02.260 --> 00:03:06.140
I got a buncha questions you could
answer for me since I just got here!

25
00:03:06.140 --> 00:03:07.800
[stomach growls]

26
00:03:08.680 --> 00:03:12.930
[giggles]
I get it!
Bet you're hungry, aren't ya?

27
00:03:17.610 --> 00:03:18.820
You think this is good?

28
00:03:18.820 --> 00:03:20.360
Should be perfect!

29
00:03:20.860 --> 00:03:24.070
No bad guys will find
your ship if it's in here!

30
00:03:25.940 --> 00:03:28.980
[LUFFY]
Dang! I'm outta food.

31
00:03:30.070 --> 00:03:33.280
[OTAMA]
Don't worry!
I know what to do, Big Brother!

32
00:03:35.320 --> 00:03:36.700
Come to my place!

33
00:03:36.700 --> 00:03:39.580
I'll pay you back by
feeding you dinner, okay?

34
00:03:42.200 --> 00:03:44.330
[OTAMA]
Komachiyo! Big Bro!

35
00:03:42.580 --> 00:03:47.080
<b>Komachiyo
A Lion-Dog</b>

36
00:03:44.330 --> 00:03:47.380
Let's go. You, too, Hihimaru!

37
00:03:47.420 --> 00:03:50.590
<b>Hihimaru
A New Friend</b>

38
00:03:50.460 --> 00:03:52.800
How did you come up with
that name for him?

39
00:03:52.800 --> 00:03:54.840
He just looked like one to me!

40
00:03:54.840 --> 00:03:57.930
Gotcha! Lead the way, Hihimaru!

41
00:03:58.340 --> 00:04:00.560
[Hihimaru grunts]

42
00:04:02.390 --> 00:04:06.690
[laughs]

43
00:04:06.690 --> 00:04:09.940
Y'know, I met a buncha pirates
and I like the good ones,

44
00:04:09.940 --> 00:04:12.240
but there are some bad ones
that I don't like.

45
00:04:18.630 --> 00:04:22.300
[giggles]
I know I'm gonna like you,

46
00:04:22.300 --> 00:04:23.970
'cause you're strong and nice!

47
00:04:34.140 --> 00:04:36.520
That's my house just up ahead!

48
00:04:38.400 --> 00:04:41.110
So you live in a village
on the mountains?

49
00:04:41.110 --> 00:04:43.360
[OTAMA]
No, it's not there anymore.

50
00:04:43.360 --> 00:04:46.400
My master and I live
all by ourselves now.

51
00:04:47.400 --> 00:04:48.410
Huh.

52
00:04:49.070 --> 00:04:52.630
Know what? When I grow up,
I'm gonna be so tough.

53
00:04:52.630 --> 00:04:54.800
A real bewitching ninja!

54
00:05:10.930 --> 00:05:13.730
It's kinda stinky and cramped in here.

55
00:05:13.130 --> 00:05:14.800
[laughs]

56
00:05:14.840 --> 00:05:17.800
[OTAMA]
Hey! That's awfully rude, Big Bro!

57
00:05:20.480 --> 00:05:21.610
[yelps]

58
00:05:21.610 --> 00:05:23.900
[gasps]
That's starting to smell good!

59
00:05:23.900 --> 00:05:26.200
Hang tight! It's almost ready!

60
00:05:30.830 --> 00:05:33.830
[LUFFY]
How much longer, Tama?

61
00:05:40.840 --> 00:05:41.880
[gasps]

62
00:05:45.800 --> 00:05:47.740
The rice is finally done!

63
00:05:48.100 --> 00:05:49.050
[OTAMA]
Here ya go.

64
00:05:49.050 --> 00:05:51.400
Fluffy, hot, and fresh outta the pot!

65
00:05:51.860 --> 00:05:53.150
Eat up, Big Bro!

66
00:05:53.150 --> 00:05:57.200
[gasps]
This rice is all for me?

67
00:05:58.030 --> 00:05:59.870
Down the hatch!

68
00:06:08.350 --> 00:06:09.970
It's yummy!

69
00:06:11.140 --> 00:06:12.390
[Otama giggles]

70
00:06:18.330 --> 00:06:20.300
Hey, Tama. You eating?

71
00:06:20.300 --> 00:06:23.050
[gasps]
Nah. I'm okay!

72
00:06:24.590 --> 00:06:28.640
Plus, kunoichi can't be fast
if they have a full belly!

73
00:06:31.350 --> 00:06:34.430
Ahh. Can I have another?

74
00:06:34.430 --> 00:06:35.970
It's gone?!

75
00:06:38.040 --> 00:06:40.790
That was all I had,
so there's no more rice left.

76
00:06:40.790 --> 00:06:42.040
[LUFFY]
What?

77
00:06:42.380 --> 00:06:45.050
As for pickles, I'm out, too.

78
00:06:45.970 --> 00:06:50.270
[LUFFY]
That's okay. I was only joking anyway.

79
00:06:55.730 --> 00:06:58.280
[OTAMA]
Huh? You're a bad liar!

80
00:06:58.280 --> 00:07:00.070
[stomach growls]

81
00:07:00.070 --> 00:07:01.450
[Otama gasps]

82
00:07:03.950 --> 00:07:05.530
[OTAMA]
I gotta run to the potty!

83
00:07:14.390 --> 00:07:15.090
full on that,

84
00:07:15.090 --> 00:07:17.300
but it was pretty nice of her
to make me food.

85
00:07:18.330 --> 00:07:21.290
That Tama girl is all right. Heh.

86
00:07:23.470 --> 00:07:26.390
You don't belong here! Who are you?

87
00:07:28.850 --> 00:07:32.440
[LUFFY]
Wait, Usopp? No, you're not!

88
00:07:34.150 --> 00:07:36.900
[HITETSU]
Why are you sprawled out on my floor?!

89
00:07:44.330 --> 00:07:45.790
[HITETSU]
Don't tell me.

90
00:07:46.370 --> 00:07:49.210
You ate the rice, didn't you?

91
00:07:49.670 --> 00:07:52.070
I did. Who are you?

92
00:07:52.070 --> 00:07:56.040
Why, you imbecile!

93
00:08:05.920 --> 00:08:09.670
Stop gurgling, tummy! How shameful!

94
00:08:11.230 --> 00:08:12.310
[gasps]

95
00:08:16.150 --> 00:08:19.150
Wait a sec! Can we talk this over?

96
00:08:19.840 --> 00:08:23.760
I mean all I did was eat the bowl
of rice that Tama cooked for me!

97
00:08:23.760 --> 00:08:26.810
Ugh. She made you food?

98
00:08:26.810 --> 00:08:29.230
Why in the world would she do that?

99
00:08:31.730 --> 00:08:36.280
Do you know how many days it's been
since she's had even a bite to eat? Well?

100
00:08:36.280 --> 00:08:37.570
[gasps]

101
00:08:37.570 --> 00:08:40.820
That poor girl weaves hats,
day in and day out,

102
00:08:40.820 --> 00:08:44.830
and if she's lucky, she'll sell the whole
batch, earning her just enough money

103
00:08:44.830 --> 00:08:47.080
to barely get by and feed herself.

104
00:08:54.580 --> 00:08:58.630
[HITETSU]
Most of the time she's forced to eat
millet, and that's if she's lucky.

105
00:08:59.040 --> 00:09:01.250
But that is not the tragic part.

106
00:09:01.250 --> 00:09:05.840
She only gets rice twice a year
for New Year's and her birthday!

107
00:09:05.820 --> 00:09:08.900
"Rice"

108
00:09:06.230 --> 00:09:08.320
I sent her to the market today.

109
00:09:09.550 --> 00:09:14.540
Because she was to buy herself a sack
of rice for her eighth birthday!

110
00:09:15.550 --> 00:09:16.750
[gasps]

111
00:09:19.790 --> 00:09:23.090
You consumed that
poor girl's only meal!

112
00:09:25.760 --> 00:09:27.380
[OTAMA]
Master!

113
00:09:27.380 --> 00:09:28.680
[HITETSU]
Huh?

114
00:09:28.680 --> 00:09:30.220
Please don't be mad!

115
00:09:30.650 --> 00:09:33.860
I know I cooked the rice
without asking first!

116
00:09:35.310 --> 00:09:36.770
I'm sorry!

117
00:09:37.570 --> 00:09:41.820
I shouldn't have, but I wanted
to repay the man who saved me!

118
00:09:42.170 --> 00:09:43.820
But please don't yell at him!

119
00:09:43.820 --> 00:09:45.570
I was the one who did it!

120
00:09:45.570 --> 00:09:48.910
I promise to weave more hats
to make it up to you!

121
00:09:48.910 --> 00:09:51.870
Try to understand! [coughs]

122
00:09:52.310 --> 00:09:54.480
I owe my life to Big Bro Luffy.

123
00:09:54.480 --> 00:09:58.270
I just wanted to repay him! Please.

124
00:09:58.270 --> 00:10:01.280
[coughs]

125
00:10:03.950 --> 00:10:04.990
Otama!

126
00:10:04.990 --> 00:10:06.070
Tama!

127
00:10:12.420 --> 00:10:13.920
Are you okay?

128
00:10:17.040 --> 00:10:19.170
You were foolish, girl!

129
00:10:19.170 --> 00:10:21.590
You filled up on
river water, didn't you?

130
00:10:21.590 --> 00:10:23.510
To ease your hunger pangs!

131
00:10:23.510 --> 00:10:25.090
She what?

132
00:10:27.390 --> 00:10:31.800
[HITETSU]
It's unfortunate,
but the waters of this land

133
00:10:31.800 --> 00:10:35.760
are polluted by runoff waste
from Kaido's factory!

134
00:10:39.850 --> 00:10:42.600
For such a small and
frail girl as herself,

135
00:10:42.600 --> 00:10:45.850
drinking it is no different
than drinking straight poison!

136
00:10:48.270 --> 00:10:51.360
Why are you guys living in
such a rundown place then?

137
00:10:53.440 --> 00:10:55.070
It's complicated.

138
00:10:55.070 --> 00:10:57.610
There are safer places she could live.

139
00:10:58.530 --> 00:11:01.410
But she has chosen to stay here.

140
00:11:03.990 --> 00:11:07.620
[HITETSU]
She's waiting for a
man who promised he'd return.

141
00:11:09.320 --> 00:11:13.410
[Luffy gasps]
Ace?

142
00:11:30.760 --> 00:11:32.680
[Luffy gasps]

143
00:11:35.430 --> 00:11:36.640
Tama.

144
00:11:39.810 --> 00:11:41.770
[LUFFY]
This "Ace" you're waiting for.

145
00:11:41.770 --> 00:11:44.660
His full name, it's

146
00:11:50.090 --> 00:11:52.510
Are you saying you know him, too?

147
00:11:52.510 --> 00:11:54.510
Really, Big Bro?

148
00:11:55.100 --> 00:11:56.140
Yeah.

149
00:12:06.320 --> 00:12:08.020
But he's dead now.

150
00:12:28.460 --> 00:12:29.790
That's a lie.

151
00:12:29.790 --> 00:12:31.000
Big Bro.

152
00:12:33.550 --> 00:12:36.300
You liar!

153
00:12:36.300 --> 00:12:38.300
[Otama cries]

154
00:12:40.850 --> 00:12:43.890
Big Bro. You are a liar!

155
00:12:44.980 --> 00:12:47.560
[Otama crying]

156
00:12:57.990 --> 00:12:59.540
[Otama coughs]

157
00:12:59.540 --> 00:13:00.810
Tama!

158
00:13:00.810 --> 00:13:01.940
[HITETSU]
Otama!

159
00:13:01.940 --> 00:13:03.480
[LUFFY]
Tama, you have to calm down!

160
00:13:09.610 --> 00:13:11.320
Looks like she fainted.

161
00:13:14.000 --> 00:13:15.480
That's crazy.

162
00:13:15.480 --> 00:13:17.650
So my brother came to Wano, too?

163
00:13:19.980 --> 00:13:22.780
What kind of devil are you?

164
00:13:23.240 --> 00:13:27.210
How could you just casually tell
poor little Otama that Ace died?

165
00:13:27.210 --> 00:13:29.130
[LUFFY]
But it's true though.

166
00:13:29.130 --> 00:13:33.380
Even if it is the truth, that
wasn't the proper way to inform her!

167
00:13:33.380 --> 00:13:36.990
Okay! But she should know
sooner than later!

168
00:13:36.990 --> 00:13:41.870
Be that as it may, you should've
considered how and when to say it!

169
00:13:41.870 --> 00:13:44.580
Have you no concept of delicacy?

170
00:13:45.750 --> 00:13:48.840
Just who in the hell
are you anyway, boy?

171
00:13:49.170 --> 00:13:53.380
My name's Luffy,
and I'll be King of the Pirates!

172
00:13:55.050 --> 00:13:58.560
Pirate? State your business here!

173
00:13:59.220 --> 00:14:01.350
I like precious few pirates.

174
00:14:01.790 --> 00:14:03.750
Why not say who you are!

175
00:14:05.130 --> 00:14:09.800
Fine then! My name is
Hitetsu the swordsmith.

176
00:14:06.950 --> 00:14:12.870
<b>Tenguyama Hitetsu

Swordsmith

(And a Collector of Beautiful Kokeshi Dolls)</b>

177
00:14:13.000 --> 00:14:16.420
Since you know Ace is gone now,
you should get outta here.

178
00:14:16.420 --> 00:14:18.920
Take Tama and move somewhere better!

179
00:14:19.910 --> 00:14:22.950
I have no greater desire
than to do that.

180
00:14:23.740 --> 00:14:25.040
Believe you me.

181
00:14:26.010 --> 00:14:30.430
But I, too, have been awaiting
someone for quite some time.

182
00:14:31.930 --> 00:14:37.900
[HITETSU]
There are only two of us now, but this
was once a village called Amigasa.

183
00:14:38.900 --> 00:14:42.140
Around a year ago,
our peaceful little home

184
00:14:42.140 --> 00:14:46.390
was attacked by one of Kaido's
newly recruited Headliners.

185
00:14:48.690 --> 00:14:52.280
[HITETSU]
A pirate by the name of X. Drake.

186
00:14:52.900 --> 00:14:54.360
[samurai yell]

187
00:14:57.130 --> 00:14:58.300
[samurai groan]

188
00:14:58.300 --> 00:15:02.640
[HITETSU]
The five samurai who protected our
territory were soundly defeated,

189
00:15:02.640 --> 00:15:04.600
our buildings were destroyed.

190
00:15:10.480 --> 00:15:15.760
[HITETSU]
Presently, there's only one place in
the Land of Wano that still flourishes.

191
00:15:15.760 --> 00:15:20.390
The Flower Capital, where
the Shogun Orochi resides.

192
00:15:22.100 --> 00:15:27.310
[HITETSU]
Everywhere else has been reduced to a
lawless wilderness by the wicked acts

193
00:15:27.310 --> 00:15:29.900
of Kaido and his followers.

194
00:15:33.080 --> 00:15:36.450
[HITETSU]
That fiend came here four years ago.

195
00:15:37.830 --> 00:15:40.670
[HITETSU]
The people who
lived here never had much.

196
00:15:41.130 --> 00:15:47.010
So, when they took away what little we had,
many of us succumbed to starvation.

197
00:15:48.170 --> 00:15:51.180
[HITETSU]
But then, when all seemed lost...

198
00:15:54.790 --> 00:15:58.130
[HITETSU]
...Ace washed up
ashore on our beach.

199
00:15:59.880 --> 00:16:03.220
[HITETSU]
Our villagers tied up
all the weakened pirates

200
00:16:03.220 --> 00:16:06.010
and consumed their food
and water supplies.

201
00:16:06.300 --> 00:16:07.680
We were desperate.

202
00:16:07.680 --> 00:16:09.890
It was our only means of survival.

203
00:16:18.230 --> 00:16:20.780
[HITETSU]
But once we devoured everything,

204
00:16:20.780 --> 00:16:24.530
to our surprise, Ace easily
broke out of his restraints.

205
00:16:26.950 --> 00:16:29.870
[HITETSU]
We feared what
retribution laid in wait for us.

206
00:16:29.870 --> 00:16:31.500
[Otama gasps]

207
00:16:38.300 --> 00:16:40.050
You get enough to eat, kid?

208
00:16:40.350 --> 00:16:41.600
Huh?

209
00:16:45.550 --> 00:16:49.850
[chuckles]
Good. I betcha
want dessert then, huh?

210
00:16:49.850 --> 00:16:50.850
Huh?

211
00:16:51.680 --> 00:16:55.520
So, tell me fellas,
where can I score some cake?

212
00:16:55.520 --> 00:16:58.060
Stay put. I'll go find us something!

213
00:16:58.650 --> 00:17:01.150
[HITETSU]
We were all utterly stunned.

214
00:17:02.400 --> 00:17:05.990
Ace and his crew ended up staying
with us for several weeks.

215
00:17:08.620 --> 00:17:10.740
[HITETSU]
Otama grew particularly fond

216
00:17:11.830 --> 00:17:13.080
of the young pirate.

217
00:17:18.670 --> 00:17:21.180
It's still hard for me to believe.

218
00:17:21.180 --> 00:17:24.340
Our lives saved by shipwrecked pirates.

219
00:17:29.810 --> 00:17:30.930
Yeah.

220
00:17:44.450 --> 00:17:45.870
That's him.

221
00:17:59.350 --> 00:18:01.560
[LUFFY]
Where can I get some food and water?

222
00:18:33.080 --> 00:18:35.040
Nice. A kimono.

223
00:18:35.040 --> 00:18:37.040
Hey. Stop squirming around!

224
00:18:37.040 --> 00:18:39.750
Do I get to wear
sweet samurai armor, too?

225
00:18:39.750 --> 00:18:42.340
[HITETSU]
You're trying not to draw attention!

226
00:18:42.340 --> 00:18:44.090
This isn't a war!

227
00:18:45.470 --> 00:18:46.880
[HITETSU]
That should do it.

228
00:18:46.880 --> 00:18:52.370
[sighs]
I cannot join you
for reasons of my own.

229
00:18:52.370 --> 00:18:54.330
Please protect her.

230
00:18:54.330 --> 00:18:57.920
Whatever costs you incur,
I shall reimburse you!

231
00:18:58.590 --> 00:18:59.880
Guess we'll see.

232
00:18:59.880 --> 00:19:03.130
If we run into my crew, I'm sure
they'll be happy to help you for free!

233
00:19:03.130 --> 00:19:05.300
So keep your fingers crossed!

234
00:19:09.640 --> 00:19:14.730
[gasps]
Whatcha got there?

235
00:19:14.210 --> 00:19:15.380
[gasps]

236
00:19:18.630 --> 00:19:20.470
It's cool if I borrow this, right?

237
00:19:21.310 --> 00:19:23.360
Really sells the look!

238
00:19:26.650 --> 00:19:28.410
Well, see ya!

239
00:19:28.410 --> 00:19:31.530
Just hang on, Tama! I'll get you help!

240
00:19:32.580 --> 00:19:35.950
Wait! Come back!
You can't take that, you fool!

241
00:19:35.950 --> 00:19:39.750
It's disrespectful to even look
at that blade without reverence!

242
00:19:39.750 --> 00:19:42.750
It's an heirloom!
Forged by my forefather!

243
00:19:42.750 --> 00:19:45.380
The renowned swordsmith Kotetsu!

244
00:19:45.380 --> 00:19:48.300
It's one of only 21
Excellent Grade Swords!

245
00:19:48.600 --> 00:19:52.480
That blade you hold
is Kitetsu the Second!

246
00:19:53.450 --> 00:19:55.030
Heed well.

247
00:19:55.030 --> 00:19:57.660
Among the innumerable
swords of the world,

248
00:19:57.660 --> 00:20:02.620
only a few are so finely crafted
as to be called "Grade Blades."

249
00:20:03.620 --> 00:20:06.630
[HITETSU]
The most superb
are grouped into classes.

250
00:20:06.630 --> 00:20:10.430
There are 50 Fine Grade,
21 Excellent Grade,

251
00:20:10.430 --> 00:20:14.560
and lastly, 12 Supreme Grade Blades.

252
00:20:15.010 --> 00:20:19.390
Kitetsu, in particular, has a
rich folklore behind it...

253
00:20:20.380 --> 00:20:22.460
He's gone? [gasps]

254
00:20:28.360 --> 00:20:30.940
I'm taking it! See ya later!

255
00:20:30.940 --> 00:20:33.740
[HITETSU]
Wait! I wasn't finished!

256
00:20:35.720 --> 00:20:40.650
[HITETSU]
I said wait! Stop! I forbid it!

257
00:20:40.990 --> 00:20:43.790
Fine! Then gimme that one at least!

258
00:20:43.790 --> 00:20:47.000
[HITETSU]
This one is a famed blade as well!

259
00:20:47.000 --> 00:20:49.170
The one you seized is cursed!

260
00:20:49.170 --> 00:20:51.290
Truly a ghastly thing!

261
00:20:51.790 --> 00:20:53.590
You don't want to wield that!

262
00:20:53.590 --> 00:20:56.760
Whoever does will
face misfortune for sure!

263
00:20:58.570 --> 00:21:00.320
[Hitetsu gasps]

264
00:21:02.660 --> 00:21:05.040
[LUFFY]
See ya later, Grandpa Nose!

265
00:21:09.710 --> 00:21:13.300
Do not let anything happen
to Otama, or so help me!

266
00:21:13.300 --> 00:21:15.260
Yeah! I'll take good care of her!

267
00:21:15.260 --> 00:21:18.340
You better return the blade as well!

268
00:21:18.800 --> 00:21:20.720
Are you listening?

269
00:21:21.640 --> 00:21:24.420
He isn't listening!

270
00:21:36.390 --> 00:21:40.020
It's the giant puppy!
Can we hitch a ride on you?

271
00:21:47.400 --> 00:21:51.070
Oh, heck yeah!
You mind taking us to town, pal?

272
00:21:51.070 --> 00:21:52.490
[Komachiyo barks]

273
00:22:01.700 --> 00:22:04.490
Oh, hey, Tama! Finally awake?

274
00:22:04.490 --> 00:22:07.500
Big Bro! Where's Komachiyo taking us?

275
00:22:07.500 --> 00:22:08.790
To the doctor.

276
00:22:09.080 --> 00:22:11.420
Do you think your dog
knows the way there?

277
00:22:14.540 --> 00:22:16.920
[Otama gasps]

278
00:22:18.130 --> 00:22:20.170
But Ace is dead now.

279
00:22:27.570 --> 00:22:29.660
[cries]

280
00:22:29.660 --> 00:22:32.830
[gasps]
Whoa-whoa, knock it off, Tama,

281
00:22:32.830 --> 00:22:34.200
or you're gonna fall!

282
00:22:34.200 --> 00:22:35.930
[cries]

283
00:22:35.930 --> 00:22:40.500
You're a big old liar!

284
00:22:40.500 --> 00:22:43.720
[Otama crying]

285
00:22:43.720 --> 00:22:46.430
I'm sorry, but Ace is gone.

286
00:22:46.930 --> 00:22:48.300
Ask anyone.

287
00:22:48.300 --> 00:22:50.930
We all know what
happened in Marineford.

288
00:23:01.400 --> 00:23:05.740
[OTAMA]
He can't be. We made a promise.

289
00:23:05.740 --> 00:23:08.740
And I know Ace wouldn't break his word!

290
00:23:16.740 --> 00:23:20.200
[OTAMA]
Ace! Take me with you on your ship!

291
00:23:21.880 --> 00:23:23.800
[OTAMA]
I'm big enough to go!

292
00:23:25.260 --> 00:23:29.470
[ACE]
Hm? But you're only five. Sorry, kid.

293
00:23:29.470 --> 00:23:31.980
So? I'll be six next year!

294
00:23:31.980 --> 00:23:33.350
You're gettin' good at that.

295
00:23:33.350 --> 00:23:34.850
'Course I am.

296
00:23:34.850 --> 00:23:37.540
[OTAMA]
You're gonna leave soon, aren't you?

297
00:23:37.540 --> 00:23:40.840
Uh-huh! I got a few things
to take care of, okay?

298
00:23:41.420 --> 00:23:42.550
Hm?

299
00:23:43.000 --> 00:23:46.090
[OTAMA]
I-I don't want you to go.

300
00:23:46.090 --> 00:23:48.180
I want you guys all to stay.

301
00:23:50.460 --> 00:23:51.750
Tama.

302
00:23:53.960 --> 00:23:55.920
I won't keep you waiting too long.

303
00:23:55.920 --> 00:23:58.720
We'll come back soon and
with a much bigger crew!

304
00:23:59.430 --> 00:24:03.850
Then, if I wait, can I join you
after you come back?

305
00:24:04.760 --> 00:24:08.140
I wanna sail and go on
an adventure with you guys!

306
00:24:10.300 --> 00:24:12.810
[ACE]
Look. A pirate's gotta be strong.

307
00:24:13.640 --> 00:24:16.350
But I'll tell you what.
When I come back,

308
00:24:16.350 --> 00:24:19.650
if you become a bewitching
ninja, I promise to take you!

309
00:24:19.650 --> 00:24:20.900
[gasps]

310
00:24:21.940 --> 00:24:25.480
Now that's cute.
Funny choice of words, though!

311
00:24:25.480 --> 00:24:29.200
[all laugh]

312
00:24:29.200 --> 00:24:31.160
[OTAMA]
Okay then!

313
00:24:31.160 --> 00:24:33.340
Do you really promise?

314
00:24:33.340 --> 00:24:35.680
No takesies backsies, okay?

315
00:24:42.350 --> 00:24:46.060
[OTAMA]
Ace... He was so kind to me.

316
00:24:46.610 --> 00:24:48.270
It's not fair.

317
00:24:48.270 --> 00:24:50.690
I waited so long for him.

318
00:24:51.530 --> 00:24:52.820
He was so nice!

319
00:24:52.820 --> 00:24:54.880
You don't know how much he meant!

320
00:24:54.880 --> 00:24:58.050
You will never understand my pain!

321
00:24:58.700 --> 00:25:01.660
Not that it hurts, but quit hittin' me!

322
00:25:02.250 --> 00:25:05.630
You're a big meanie!
You don't care at all!

323
00:25:08.630 --> 00:25:12.360
[OTAMA]
You're no Big Bro! You're just a jerk!

324
00:25:18.030 --> 00:25:21.280
[gasps]
That's the end of the forest!

325
00:25:32.980 --> 00:25:35.100
[LUFFY]
Grandpa Nose was right.

326
00:25:35.100 --> 00:25:39.220
It's not a joke.
It really is a wasteland!

327
00:25:48.810 --> 00:25:50.520
A tiger!

328
00:25:52.440 --> 00:25:54.520
And a big boar, too!

329
00:25:54.980 --> 00:25:57.150
[roars]

330
00:25:57.780 --> 00:25:59.190
[LUFFY]
What's that thing?

331
00:25:59.190 --> 00:26:01.080
[OTAMA]
Oh! That's a sharkodile!

332
00:26:01.080 --> 00:26:03.460
[LUFFY]
This place is wild!

333
00:26:05.720 --> 00:26:08.560
Just eat those guys!
Then you won't be so hungry!

334
00:26:08.560 --> 00:26:09.660
It's not that easy.

335
00:26:09.660 --> 00:26:10.790
All the samurai who were

336
00:26:11.650 --> 00:26:15.360
powerful enough to take them down
were either caught by the police

337
00:26:15.360 --> 00:26:18.150
or they turned into bandits to survive.

338
00:26:18.560 --> 00:26:19.980
Besides.

339
00:26:23.970 --> 00:26:27.220
[OTAMA]
Animals around here
drink the polluted river water.

340
00:26:27.220 --> 00:26:31.180
'Cause of that, they become
way too poisonous for us to eat.

341
00:26:32.410 --> 00:26:35.200
But they look so meaty and tasty!

342
00:26:35.200 --> 00:26:37.370
That's unforgivable.

343
00:26:37.790 --> 00:26:40.420
Is that the factory
making all the smoke?

344
00:26:40.830 --> 00:26:42.590
[OTAMA]
Yeah, that's right!

345
00:26:42.920 --> 00:26:46.570
They make weapons and they have
a mine there and that's not all.

346
00:26:46.570 --> 00:26:50.490
That place is full of bad guys
that work for Kaido!

347
00:26:52.340 --> 00:26:55.060
[LUFFY]
Well, what do they eat, then?

348
00:26:56.250 --> 00:26:59.000
The Shogun and Kaido have a farm.

349
00:26:59.000 --> 00:27:00.630
No one else can use it.

350
00:27:01.130 --> 00:27:03.670
It makes food just for them.

351
00:27:06.090 --> 00:27:10.090
[OTAMA]
They have clean water and rice fields,

352
00:27:10.090 --> 00:27:13.180
and veggies, and fish, too.

353
00:27:13.180 --> 00:27:15.220
[stomach growls]

354
00:27:15.640 --> 00:27:18.020
Plus, a lot of meat.

355
00:27:19.410 --> 00:27:23.040
I gotcha! So they do have
food around here!

356
00:27:23.580 --> 00:27:24.710
[Luffy gasps]

357
00:27:24.710 --> 00:27:28.050
Tama! You okay? Talk to me!

358
00:27:28.050 --> 00:27:31.880
Oh no! I think your fever's
getting even worse!

359
00:27:34.640 --> 00:27:40.020
Just hang on, okay?
I'll get you to a doctor!

360
00:27:42.110 --> 00:27:46.030
If those jerks have enough food and
water, then I'll make this work!

361
00:27:46.480 --> 00:27:47.990
Hurry it up, Dog!

362
00:27:47.990 --> 00:27:49.280
[Komachiyo barks]

363
00:27:51.900 --> 00:27:57.030
[Otsuru screams]
Please show mercy on me!

364
00:27:57.370 --> 00:27:59.370
[bandits cackle]

365
00:27:59.370 --> 00:28:00.450
[gasps]

366
00:28:00.450 --> 00:28:02.000
[BANDIT B]
You can't outrun us!

367
00:28:02.000 --> 00:28:04.710
[BANDIT A]
Drop everything you've got, lady!

368
00:28:04.710 --> 00:28:07.960
I beg of you! Someone, help!

369
00:28:13.800 --> 00:28:15.380
[screams]

370
00:28:17.360 --> 00:28:18.660
[grunts]

371
00:28:19.950 --> 00:28:21.910
[bandits groan]

372
00:28:25.830 --> 00:28:29.000
You bastard! I'll make you pay!

373
00:28:29.500 --> 00:28:32.170
Stay back. I'll handle this.

374
00:28:38.220 --> 00:28:39.430
[bandits gasp]

375
00:28:39.700 --> 00:28:43.120
"Zorojuro, Wanted for Murdering a Magistrate"

376
00:28:40.220 --> 00:28:43.470
[BANDIT B]
I know that face! You're Zorojuro!

377
00:29:39.550 --> 00:29:41.630
Good sir, whoever you are.

378
00:29:41.630 --> 00:29:45.510
Thank you for saving me.
I owe you my life.

379
00:29:48.060 --> 00:29:49.470
Whew!

380
00:29:50.600 --> 00:29:52.730
Stand up. No big deal.

381
00:29:52.730 --> 00:29:56.150
I was just after that
bozo's jug of saké anyway.

382
00:29:56.940 --> 00:29:58.570
I mean honorably speaking.

383
00:29:58.570 --> 00:30:01.280
But surely, I can repay you somehow.

384
00:30:01.650 --> 00:30:04.530
[ZORO]
Hmm. More saké!

385
00:30:04.530 --> 00:30:07.580
[OTSURU]
I don't have any on my person.

386
00:30:16.790 --> 00:30:18.250
[gasps]

387
00:30:18.920 --> 00:30:21.050
Zoro!

388
00:30:21.340 --> 00:30:23.550
Hey! Zoro!

389
00:30:23.550 --> 00:30:27.050
It's me! Over here!

390
00:30:27.600 --> 00:30:32.980
[gasps]
Luffy, yeah!
You finally made it!

391
00:30:32.980 --> 00:30:39.520
[giggles]
It's real good
to see you! Zoro!

392
00:30:39.800 --> 00:30:41.970
[laughs]

393
00:30:41.970 --> 00:30:44.260
[Luffy giggles]
Woo-hoo!

394
00:30:44.260 --> 00:30:46.140
It's been a while...

395
00:30:46.140 --> 00:30:47.470
[laughs]

396
00:30:47.470 --> 00:30:50.770
It's been a long time,
most honorable Zoro!

397
00:30:50.770 --> 00:30:53.730
[Luffy giggles]

398
00:30:56.290 --> 00:30:57.790
Is everyone with you?

399
00:30:57.790 --> 00:31:00.210
Yeah. But we got split up.

400
00:31:00.210 --> 00:31:03.000
Eh. They're okay!

401
00:31:09.830 --> 00:31:13.480
Whoa! I smell meat! Gimme a snack!

402
00:31:13.480 --> 00:31:16.940
There're so many fish and animals around
here, you would not believe it, Luffy!

403
00:31:16.940 --> 00:31:18.150
Here ya go!

404
00:31:19.610 --> 00:31:21.950
This whole area has so much to hunt!

405
00:31:21.950 --> 00:31:23.910
[LUFFY]
No! Be careful!

406
00:31:23.910 --> 00:31:27.500
The water in this place is
poisonous and the wildlife drink it!

407
00:31:27.500 --> 00:31:31.330
So if you got this off an animal
here, then it's poisoned, too!

408
00:31:31.330 --> 00:31:32.460
Checks out.

409
00:31:32.460 --> 00:31:34.920
I guess that's why my stomach hurts.

410
00:31:43.410 --> 00:31:46.630
Anyway, Zoro, we should
probably get going now!

411
00:31:46.630 --> 00:31:49.220
I ran into this little girl,
one thing led to another,

412
00:31:49.220 --> 00:31:51.260
and now I need to take her to a doctor.

413
00:31:51.260 --> 00:31:52.510
She's not feeling good!

414
00:31:52.510 --> 00:31:56.180
[gasps]
Yeah! The brat's
in rough shape!

415
00:31:57.180 --> 00:31:59.890
Why the heck are you
stopping to eat then?!

416
00:32:00.440 --> 00:32:03.230
It'll be okay! I'll be done in a sec!

417
00:32:08.810 --> 00:32:10.770
[ZORO]
Just choke it down already!

418
00:32:10.770 --> 00:32:12.150
[LUFFY]
Tryin'!

419
00:32:21.050 --> 00:32:22.890
[HAWKINS]
Hello, gentlemen.

420
00:32:24.120 --> 00:32:27.870
How fortunate that I've found
the fugitive ronin, himself.

421
00:32:28.120 --> 00:32:29.710
Zorojuro.

422
00:32:30.310 --> 00:32:32.560
And he brought companions.

423
00:32:38.110 --> 00:32:40.110
Wait a minute, we know him.

424
00:32:40.110 --> 00:32:44.740
[ZORO]
Yeah. Be careful, seems
like he's working for Kaido.

425
00:32:47.490 --> 00:32:49.500
Straw Hat is here?

426
00:32:50.660 --> 00:32:53.420
I was just on my way to Kuri Beach.

427
00:32:54.330 --> 00:32:57.710
I presume you're the culprit
behind the shoreline assault?

428
00:32:58.960 --> 00:33:02.970
[HAWKINS]
I was told I lost
two subordinates and one baboon.

429
00:33:05.050 --> 00:33:10.550
<b>Basil Hawkins
One of the Beast Pirates' Headliners</b>

430
00:33:07.960 --> 00:33:13.670
The likelihood that you were behind
the attack is 98 percent, huh?

431
00:33:14.720 --> 00:33:18.180
[HAWKINS]
However, that does not matter now.

432
00:33:20.600 --> 00:33:23.850
In the Land of Wano,
you must choose your path.

433
00:33:24.350 --> 00:33:27.230
Follow the strong or become their prey.

434
00:33:33.620 --> 00:33:36.840
I think we're about to
piss Kin'emon off, huh, Luffy?

435
00:33:37.630 --> 00:33:39.800
He warned us to not make a scene.

436
00:33:41.460 --> 00:33:42.920
[Luffy chuckles]

437
00:33:47.470 --> 00:33:50.140
Uh-huh. Well, too bad!

438
00:33:50.680 --> 00:33:52.680
I'll apologize later.
